---
description: Nexus and Obsidian workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the repo-local `nexus` MCP server for live Obsidian operations only after inspecting tool schemas with `toolManager_getTools`.

If Nexus does not respond, record a GAP and use filesystem-backed notes under `docs/ai/` until the live runtime is available.

Never store API keys, tokens, cookies, passwords, private credentials, or raw secret values in Obsidian, Graphify, MCP config, logs, or repo docs.

